<title>USA: Game Financial wins license in Arizona.</title>
<headline>Game Financial wins license in Arizona.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Game Financial Corp said Thursday it received from the Arizona Department of Gaming a temporary license to offer GameCash check cashing, credit card cash advance and ATM services in the state of Arizona.</p>
<p>Game Financial provides gaming establishments, primarily casinos, with services that allow their patrons to access cash through the use of credit card cash advance services, check cashing services and automated teller machines (ATMs).</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
